{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【ACGHK 2026】迎接20週年的「ROG」攤位報導！鍵盤、滑鼠等人氣電競週邊齊聚一堂</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7cd0f247425f4b3ce0091f6ea2e3be2bb34ac6968efcb217d9877f7f21d2b2cf/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fba067b03648842b7ccd859f313457ea4\"/><p>於2026年7月24日(五)～28日(二)舉辦的「 ACGHK 2026 」－「Ani-Com &amp; Games Hong Kong 2026(香港動漫電玩節2026)」 本次為大家介紹於2026年迎來20週年的「 Republic of Gamers 」(以下稱ROG)攤位！</p><h3>「ROG」攤位報導！20週年紀念特別展示</h3><p>「ROG」攤位</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e52063497fabfe7cfa3e91c0ccefc5ad388064a4016f10d91cf6b4018f27c771/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0a5bcbecdf71036f57bde79e9a3c3d85\"/><p>ASUS的電競品牌「 ROG 」迎來20週年，攤位也採特別規格！</p><p>ROG Edition 20</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e9fc403979b97b0e4ff765b5ece83382c3a952d39273ed4b868b67b1a3f70a7b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F03c4e273f8b35991b367889abc908049\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8a2497f574c846fae07b38fd7763a55438d80599b232d07bfdc3693140675cca/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F25a91023728fd25748ac65b1f66e4c14\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f2af6d8a763d1667997fba5b67894fbf48ff6dd2fc8e251f068eb61c59191bb6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0aaf9010a21725b2369d05aca1e1a2f8\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/65de2de8cd188e5690407bf7469bbe9ba42e755ff87ffe3abe5931b80a6918bc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd565e5fb1625783003f1c6077d8ed0a5\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3acc2d3c23e3c2b433f8ebe3557df2b117fd43ba5f9d22d661341d5a490ec4cb/l