=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/da4f04a3193026dfa95fdb62f5fd469bc0ede6f39dae789b3dc2c7093d42b4fc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6bf5e4d421cf5034b00d56410c1d7061\"/><p>陳列著各式設計的鍵盤專區。</p><p>TUF Gaming K3 Gen II Hatsune Miku Edition</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2b878d39db8f7f7e4c427686a5bb35f7523de1e871fe39ab245eee5a3f531b07/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F00a245fd91dfcddb306565a23a497dfc\"/><p>與初音未來的聯名產品「TUF Gaming K3 Gen II Hatsune Miku Edition」 配色為Miku規格，亮眼的色彩相當可愛。</p><p>機械軸</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/742579402717d0a9087454ca9af9325906da617079bd15723f2ce60592866eb5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb56469864f4c1efac6a2c04ea5700b97\"/><p>機械軸也有展示。</p><p>電競滑鼠</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c3fe0dd10a668766b2cdca5a32388748beb3150fd4d6b07b1c1cd2f5a17d0338/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F736b0989dc8990ef72e1824feb37d7d7\"/><p>人氣滑鼠系列也有展示。</p><p>電競螢幕</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0c0692a9ec5434efb90b96d1e526af22fa120ae817560d955036890f5b72eb88/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb50abe27b3dc64e445f8af206adaa1d2\"/><p>玩家不可或缺的電競螢幕也有。 能親眼確認顏色與尺寸，這點很棒。</p><p>耳機</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b128bd0ac4d93d882644a6a156bfd1583e0cf8d4da8f31b18b437846e54d8bc9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fac2c4dd1c9326f8652f3b3636830b887\"/><p>耳機的種類也相當豐富。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a0249b051e7af155fe9ea4c07e99994f8e05974c7ce8633a525c3ec4a9a94345/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%